50", "width": 150}], "start": 239, "status": 200, "title": "Sunshade for NASA’s NEO Surveyor Mission Ready for Its Day in Sun - NASA Science", "unwound_url": "https://science.nasa.gov/blogs/neo-surveyor/2026/10/26/sunshade-for-nasas-neo-surveyor-mission-ready-for-its-day-in-sun/?utm_source=TWITTER&utm_medium=NASA&utm_campaign=NASASocial&linkId=1032818590", "url": "https://t.co/YRl0x5EpVG"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/WfEEHv9aOs", "end": 286, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/NASA/status/2118779276547756448/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118779272298926080", "start": 263, "url": "https://t.co/WfEEHv9aOs"}]}, "id": "2118779276547756448", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 47, "impression_count": 499620, "like_count": 1428, "quote_count": 17, "reply_count": 117, "retweet_count": 182}, "text": "Nice shades. 😎\n\nThis sunshade will fly on NEO Surveyor, a spacecraft that will spot nearby asteroids and comets that ground-based telescopes might miss. The sunshade will help by harnessing the Sun’s power and blocking its blinding glare: https://t.co/YRl0x5EpVG https://t.co/WfEEHv9aOs", "url": "https://x.com/NASA/status/2118779276547756448"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-06T16:26:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118741813494419727"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/oldmate87/stat…", "end": 177, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/oldmate87/status/2118710393606701367", "start": 154, "url": "https://t.co/QfML4vPbF7"}]}, "id": "2118741813494419727", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 2137, "like_count": 24, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118710393606701367", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Ever looked at prices adjusted for prices? Prices are much pricier compared to prices adjusted for prices! We are price adjusting prices over here folks! https://t.co/QfML4vPbF7", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2118741813494419727"}, {"author_id": "34743251", "created_at": "2026-11-06T14:56:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118719281038770389"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/J2bA23f6a1", "end": 299, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/SpaceX/status/2118719281038770389/video/1", "media_key": "13_2118716025151619072", "start": 276, "url": "https://t.co/J2bA23f6a1"}]}, "id": "2118719281038770389", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6188, "impression_count": 35022844, "like_count": 28759, "quote_count": 538, "reply_count": 1013, "retweet_count": 3864}, "text": "More than a dozen flight tests and years of development, with countless hours worked by SpaceX engineers and technicians, all come down to this: the first orbital Starship launch carrying advanced Starlink satellites bound for space. \n\nWatch “Go For Orbit” and experience the https://t.co/J2bA23f6a1", "url": "https://x.com/SpaceX/status/2118719281038770389"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-06T13:44:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118700934964334875"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/kuzeyokumaps/s…", "end": 36, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/kuzeyokumaps/status/2118386329537196320", "start": 13, "url": "https://t.co/FJy1mdiW5X"}]}, "id": "2118700934964334875", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 2400, "like_count": 14, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118386329537196320", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "This is cool https://t.co/FJy1mdiW5X", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2118700934964334875"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-06T13:41:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118700213846368473"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/cernovich/stat…", "end": 66, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/cernovich/status/2118424376760762385", "start": 43, "url": "https://t.co/4zHXCHKul1"}]}, "id": "2118700213846368473", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1485, "like_count": 12, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118424376760762385", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "America wants to see their Kalshi accounts https://t.co/4zHXCHKul1", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2118700213846368473"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-06T13:36:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118698963976994907"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/lennybronner/s…", "end": 70, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/lennybronner/status/2118385612940063099", "start": 47, "url": "https://t.co/ivZCq3jED1"}]}, "id": "2118698963976994907", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 2170, "like_count": 35, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118385612940063099", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Republicans voters hung Trump’s GOP out to dry https://t.co/ivZCq3jED1", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2118698963976994907"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-06T13:21:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118695342464004209"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/megbasham/stat…", "end": 294, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/megbasham/status/2118523890221891931", "start": 271, "url": "https://t.co/4Lsyg3BxBz"}]}, "id": "2118695342464004209", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 4011, "like_count": 99, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 14, "retweet_count": 3}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118523890221891931", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "I think you have to realize what it was about the Iran War, though.\n\nIt wasn't that Americans were Big Sad we bombed people.\n\nIt was gas prices.\n\n\"The Iran War\" polled as a #4 also-ran issue.\n\nAffordability (including gas prices) was the #1 issue, and corruption was #2. https://t.co/4Lsyg3BxBz", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2118695342464004209"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-06T02:33:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118532319137198081"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/jt_kerwin/stat…", "end": 158, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/jt_kerwin/status/2118523774517838170", "start": 135, "url": "https://t.co/9cDBcnb5xP"}]}, "id": "2118532319137198081", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 3144, "like_count": 12, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118523774517838170", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "It’s because Ancestry owns the actual data and Ancestry imposes terms of use\n\nWhich you’d know if you read the documentation materials https://t.co/9cDBcnb5xP", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2118532319137198081"}, {"author_id": "17217640", "created_at": "2026-11-05T23:49:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118490856839913908"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 172, "id": "28184452", "start": 158, "username": "NASA_Marshall"}], "urls": [{"description": "NASA is working to send astronauts back to the Moon for the first t...", "display_url": "youtu.be/6zsziM7mGII", "end": 279, "expanded_url": "https://youtu.be/6zsziM7mGII", "images": [{"height": 720, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2118490860954550272/o5ux1ZX6?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1280}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2118490860954550272/o5ux1ZX6?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 256, "status": 200, "title": "Blue Origin, SpaceX race to become 1st to carry NASA astronauts to the Moon", "unwound_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6zsziM7mGII&feature=youtu.be", "url": "https://t.co/B8enkUH1ST"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/mVSjTqzvIx", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/SpaceflightNow/status/2118490856839913908/video/1", "media_key": "13_2118484844061569026", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/mVSjTqzvIx"}]}, "id": "2118490856839913908", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 14, "impression_count": 9138, "like_count": 95, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 14}, "text": "NASA's Artemis 4 mission features the first Moon landing since Apollo 17 and will use either Blue Origin's Blue Moon Mk2 or SpaceX's Starship. We traveled to @NASA_Marshall to understand the progress of the landers and the choice facing NASA.\n\nFull video: https://t.co/B8enkUH1ST https://t.co/mVSjTqzvIx", "url": "https://x.com/SpaceflightNow/status/2118490856839913908"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-05T22:58:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118478004318023959"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/patrickruffini…", "end": 265, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/patrickruffini/status/2118412496755421416", "start": 242, "url": "https://t.co/Fp86YpKDae"}]}, "id": "2118478004318023959", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 11, "impression_count": 4329, "like_count": 82, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 5}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118412496755421416", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "A recurring theme is:\n\nRepublicans say the midterms out in large numbers.\n\nVoters who showed up were mad about affordability and corruption. But the election was *decided* by Republicans deciding the GOP as it stands wasn’t worth their time. https://t.co/Fp86YpKDae", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2118478004318023959"}, {"author_id": "11348282", "created_at": "2026-11-05T21:04:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118449337814352016"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/OV4lxCW1tk", "end": 297, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/NASA/status/2118449337814352016/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118447998266941440", "start": 274, "url": "https://t.co/OV4lxCW1tk"}]}, "id": "2118449337814352016", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1037, "impression_count": 1506100, "like_count": 18551, "quote_count": 222, "reply_count": 537, "retweet_count": 2165}, "text": "Flying high!\n\nToday, our X-59 quiet supersonic X-59 aircraft traveled from Birmingham, Alabama, to Daytona Beach, Florida. The aircraft aims to fly faster than sound with just a gentle thump rather than a sonic boom — helping usher in a new era of faster air travel.\n\nWe're https://t.co/OV4lxCW1tk", "url": "https://x.com/NASA/status/2118449337814352016"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "11348282", "name": "NASA", "username": "NASA"}, {"id": "46648807", "name": "National Institute of Standards and Technology", "username": "NIST"}, {"id": "19355829", "name": "Jonathan McDowell", "username": "planet4589"}, {"id": "626660983", "name": "Lyman Stone 石來民 🦬🦬🦬", "username": "lymanstoneky"}, {"id": "34743251", "name": "SpaceX", "username": "SpaceX"}, {"id": "17217640", "name": "Spaceflight Now", "username": "SpaceflightNow"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2118840871932358819", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzlyxj7tkgp49ka5qt7mq0bpoyagt", "oldest_id": "2118449337814352016", "result_count": 17}}
